OL,3,AVeteran broadcaster Dame Esther Rantzen
OL,4,Adies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe launched Childline, a British
OL,7,Fcounselling service for children and
OL,8,Fyoung people, in 1986, and in 2013 she
OL,9,Flaunched Silver Line to help elderly
OL,10,Fpeople suffering from isolation and
OL,11,Floneliness. Later in life, she became a
OL,12,Fprominent campaigner for the
OL,13,Flegalisation of assisted dying.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
