OL,3,AWe fear for our lives after being told
OL,4,Aour abusive exes will be freed from
OL,5,Ajail early
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree women who have been told their
OL,8,Fabusive ex-partners will be released
OL,9,Fearly from jail as part of
OL,10,Fcontroversial plans to free up prison
OL,11,Fspace have said they fear for their
OL,12,Fsafety.
OL,14,FAround 700 offenders will leave prison
OL,15,Fin England and Wales on Thursday under
OL,16,Fthe government's early prisoner release
OL,17,Fplan - with a further 3,800 scheduled
OL,18,Ffor release over the next year.
OL,20,FAhead of the releases, victims have
OL,21,Fbeen sent letters informing them that
OL,22,Ftheir attackers will be let out early.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
