OL,3,AToo early to say what motive for
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack was,
OL,5,AIsraeli PM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu has said it is too early to
OL,9,Fsay what was behind the foiled attempt
OL,10,Fby a co-pilot to crash an Emirati
OL,11,Fflight from Dubai to Tel Aviv.
OL,13,FThere is no suggestion yet from
OL,14,Fauthorities of a motive for the
OL,15,Fattacking pilot, but asked by Fox News
OL,16,Fwhether there was any indication of
OL,17,FIran's involvement, Netanyahu replied:
OL,18,F"It's too early to say."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
