OL,3,AToo early to say what motive for
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack was,
OL,5,AIsraeli PM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said the attacker was being
OL,8,Finvestigated in Saudi Arabia, where he
OL,9,Fwas arrested after the Flydubai plane
OL,10,Fmade an emergency landing.
OL,12,FShaken passengers described how they
OL,13,Fburst into the cockpit and wrestled
OL,14,Fwith the attacker as the aircraft
OL,15,Fdescended sharply.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
